-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §105: a non-academic first deputy works the
-- academic first deputy's week (§90).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-90`

-- not weighed against `the Hours of Work and Rest Law`: gives first deputies
-- who are not academics the week of §90, and changes none of its hours;
-- §90's file weighs it against §3.

§ `105 מבנה שבוע העבודה של סגני מנהלים ראשונים שאינם אקדמאים`

@ref akn:art_105
`a non-academic first deputy's weekly hours` MEANS `a first deputy's weekly hours`

#ASSERT `a non-academic first deputy's weekly hours` EQUALS 40
